      "id": "claim_405e96080ae643619963331c7ec6afdc",
      "statement": "Bearer mode stores JWT in localStorage (key: rh_access_token) and attaches it via Authorization: Bearer header, while cookie mode uses Ulabase's HttpOnly JWT cookie that only works with same-origin deployments.",
