    {
      "id": "claim_1073a934178047dbb2f6465ed94b2df6",
      "statement": "checkSession() ends the session only on a 401/403 response or a user document carrying the $unauthenticated role; 429, 5xx and network failures (status 0) are retried through withRetry() — four attempts in all, waiting a readable Retry-After capped at 60 seconds (20 seconds when the header cannot be read) after a 429, and a short attempt-scaled pause after a 5xx or network failure.",
